# Codex gasified-LNG CH4 warmed-vapor fire surrogate, rank-mapped MPI+CUDA.
# Requires a CH4-capable chemistry mechanism build. This covers pre-vaporized,
# warmed methane-rich gas fire behavior. It is not a liquid LNG model, not
# cryogenic LNG rupture, flashing, pool evaporation, or cold dense-cloud fire
# validation.
